{
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.KihaSPOIDAHAI.KihaAxeSwings": "While they're tangled up with you, however, Kiha takes the opportunity to get in a few shallow swings with her axe, to the accompaniment of crunching chitin."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.KihaSPOIDAHAI.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.KihaSPOIDAHAI.Text": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.KihaSPOIDAHAI.WhileTheyReTangled": "While they're tangled up with you, however, Kiha takes the opportunity to get in a few shallow swings with her axe, to the accompaniment of crunching chitin."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.ANumberOfSpiders": "A number of spiders rush at you, trying to claw and bite you. You manage to beat them all back, though, with some literal covering fire from Kiha."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.ANumberOfSpiders.Two": "A number of spiders rush at you, trying to claw and bite you. You manage to knock most of them away, but a few nasty hits manage to punch through your [armorName]. "
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.ArmorAbsorbs": "You absorb and deflect every {0} with your [armor]."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.BrushAgainstYourExposed": "\\\n{0}{1} brush against your exposed skin and jerk back in surprise, coloring slightly from seeing so much of you revealed."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.BrushSurprisePlural": "\n{0}{1} brush against your exposed skin and jerk back in surprise, coloring slightly from seeing so much of you revealed."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.BrushSurpriseReveal": "\n{0}{1} brushes against your exposed skin and jerks back in surprise, coloring slightly from seeing so much of you revealed."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.BrushesAgainstYourExposed": "\\\n{0}{1} brushes against your exposed skin and jerks back in surprise, coloring slightly from seeing so much of you revealed."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.DeflectBlocks": "You deflect and block every {0} {1}{2} throws at you."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.GlancingBlow": "You are struck a glancing blow by {0}{1}!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.HordeBeatenBack": "A number of spiders rush at you, trying to claw and bite you. You manage to beat them all back, though, with some literal covering fire from Kiha."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.HordeFewHits": "A number of spiders rush at you, trying to claw and bite you. You manage to knock most of them away, but a few nasty hits manage to punch through your [armorName]. "
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.MutilateYouWithPowerful": "{0}{1} <b>mutilate</b> you with {2} powerful {3}!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.MutilatingBlow": "{0}{1} <b>mutilate</b> you with {2} powerful {3}!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.StaggeringBlow": "{0}{1} staggers you with the force of {2} {3}!"
