  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.YouAreStruckA": "You are struck a glancing blow by {0}{1}!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpiderStandardAttack.YouDeflectAndBlock": "You deflect and block every {0} {1}{2} throws at you."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpoidahHordeWebLaunchahs.OneOfTheDriders": "One of the driders launches a huge glob of webbing right at you! Luckily, Kiha manages to burn it out of the air with a well-timed gout of flame!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpoidahHordeWebLaunchahs.SomeOfTheSpiders": "Some of the spiders and driders launch huge globs of wet webbing right at you, hitting you in the torso! You try to wiggle out, but it's no use; you're stuck like this for now. Though comfortingly, the driders' open stance and self-satisfaction allow Kiha to blast them in the side with a huge conflagration!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpoidahHordeWebLaunchahs.WebBurnedAir": "One of the driders launches a huge glob of webbing right at you! Luckily, Kiha manages to burn it out of the air with a well-timed gout of flame!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.SpoidahHordeWebLaunchahs.WebHitTorso": "Some of the spiders and driders launch huge globs of wet webbing right at you, hitting you in the torso! You try to wiggle out, but it's no use; you're stuck like this for now. Though comfortingly, the driders' open stance and self-satisfaction allow Kiha to blast them in the side with a huge conflagration!"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.Struggle.ClawOutWebbing": "You claw your way out of the webbing while Kiha does her best to handle the spiders single-handedly![pg]"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.Struggle.YouClawYourWay": "You claw your way out of the webbing while Kiha does her best to handle the spiders single-handedly![pg]"
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.Won.SpidersCloseIn": "[pg]The spiders smile to one at another as they watch your display, then close in..."
  "Scenes.SpiderMorphMob.Won.TheSpidersSmileTo": "[pg]The spiders smile to one at another as they watch your display, then close in..."
}
